  description: 'All monsters you control gain ATK/DEF equal to the number of different
    Attributes in your GY x 200. Once per turn: You can add 1 "Elementsaber" monster
    from your Deck to your hand, but skip the Battle Phase of your next turn (even
    if this card leaves the field). Once per turn, if an "Elementsaber" monster in
    your hand or field would send a card(s) from the hand to the GY to activate an
    effect, you can send that many "Elementsaber" monster(s) from your Deck to the
    GY, instead.'
